flowchart TD
    A[🔐 User Accesses Protected Route] --> B{Session Cookie Exists?}
    B -->|No| C[Redirect to /login]
    C --> D[User Clicks Sign In]
    D --> E[Redirect to Microsoft Entra ID]
    E --> F[User Enters Credentials]
    F --> G{Authentication Success?}
    G -->|No| H[Show Error]
    G -->|Yes| I[Microsoft Returns Auth Code]
    I --> J[NextAuth Exchanges Code for Tokens]
    J --> K[Store tokens in encrypted JWT]
    K --> L[Set HTTP-only Session Cookie]
    L --> M[Redirect to Original URL]
    
    B -->|Yes| N{Token Expired?}
    N -->|No| O[Allow Access]
    N -->|Yes| P[Refresh Token]
    P --> Q{Refresh Success?}
    Q -->|Yes| O
    Q -->|No| C
    
    O --> R[Call /api/verify-token]
    R --> S{Groups in ID Token?}
    S -->|Yes| T[Extract groups array]
    S -->|No| U[Call MS Graph API]
    U --> V[GET /me/memberOf]
    V --> T
    T --> W[Check ADMIN_GROUP_ID]
    W --> X[Check VIEW_GROUP_ID]
    X --> Y[Return isAdmin, isViewer]
    
    style A fill:#e1f5fe
    style O fill:#c8e6c9
    style C fill:#ffcdd2
    style Y fill:#c8e6c9
